ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: De Stijl
Board: /styles/de-stijl
Companions: de-stijl-starter.html, de-stijl-study.ai, de-stijl-study.psd

Artboards
1. Equilibrium, 2400 × 2400 px. Black bars, three primary rectangles, white as a color. Asymmetric.
2. A rejected state, same size, with one diagonal, labeled "not this" — so the rule is visible by the break. The first artboard is the study.

Palette
White #f7f4ee. Black #111111. Red #e31c23. Blue #0047ab. Yellow #f5c400.

Rules
- No diagonal on artboard 1. No circle. No type. No gradient.
- White areas must differ in size. A centered emblem fails.
- Do not redraw a Mondrian, a Rietveld, or the Schröder House.
- Not the Bauhaus starter. That one may use a circle. This one may not.
